From: Plain Browser
Subject: [credits] List Plain Browser, ungoogled-chromium and the bundled filter lists in chrome://credits

licenses.py only walks third_party directories plus ADDITIONAL_PATHS. Our code lives in //plainbrowser, so it is added
here; each directory has a README.chromium with its license file. Needs generate_about_credits=true.
---
--- a/tools/licenses/licenses.py
+++ b/tools/licenses/licenses.py
@@ -195,6 +195,10 @@
   # Fake directories to include the strongtalk and fdlibm licenses.
   os.path.join('v8', 'strongtalk'),
   os.path.join('v8', 'fdlibm'),
+  # Plain Browser: its own code, the bundled filter lists and the ungoogled-chromium patch set.
+  os.path.join('plainbrowser'),
+  os.path.join('plainbrowser', 'adblock', 'lists'),
+  os.path.join('plainbrowser', 'ungoogled'),
 )
 
 # SPECIAL_CASES are used for historical directories where we checked out
